# Databases
*.sqlite
*.db
*.backup
*.bak*
# SQLite's write-ahead log and shared-memory sidecars. *.db above does not
# cover them (the suffix continues past .db), so a `git add -A` on a machine
# running the server swept the live stats.db-wal — real user rows — into the
# index. They are also worthless without the .db they belong to.
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm

# TypeScript build cache
*.tsbuildinfo

# Token Savior MCP code index cache (generated, machine/path-specific)
.token-savior-cache.json
